  "text": "About Care Navigation - Arista Advanced Pet Care\nSkip to main content\nHome\nmobile menu icon\nLocations\nFind My Arista\nAtlanta\nDallas\nJacksonville\nPet Owners\nEmergency\nSpecialty Referral & Care Navigation\nPayments\nFAQ\nVeterinarians\nMake a Referral\nAbout Care Navigation\nVeterinarian Openings\nAbout Us\nWhat Is Arista?\nOur Leadership\nNews\nBlogs\nContact Us\nCareers\nCompany Overview\nOwnership Opportunities for Veterinarians\nVeterinarians\nCare Navigation & Management\nTechnicians & Assistants\nVeterinarian Openings\nNon-Veterinarian Openings\nMake a Referral\nEmergency\nHome\nLocations\nFind My Arista\nAtlanta\nDallas\nJacksonville\nPet Owners\nEmergency\nSpecialty Referral & Care Navigation\nPayments\nFAQ\nVeterinarians\nMake a Referral\nAbout Care Navigation\nVeterinarian Openings\nAbout Us\nWhat Is Arista?\nOur Leadership\nNews\nBlogs\nContact Us\nCareers\nCompany Overview\nOwnership Opportunities for Veterinarians\nVeterinarians\nCare Navigation & Management\nTechnicians & Assistants\nVeterinarian Openings\nNon-Veterinarian Openings\nMake a Referral\nEmergency\nVeterinarians\nCare Navigation\nOUR CARE NAVIGATORS\nSeamless Support and Care\nCare Navigators are assigned to pet owners to streamline and make the experience of referral as stress free, transparent & supportive as possible. They serve as a point of contact, facilitate all the details including medical record transfer, scheduling, follw-ups and ensuring clear communication across the whole care team.\nSupported by industry leading technology, Arista Care Navigators ensure you and your team have access to advanced care support with easy exchange of information, ultimately leading to better outcomes for pets.\nCare Navigation Benefits\nSTREAMLINED\nSPECIALTY CARE\nPERSONALIZED\nAPPROACH\nCLEAR, RELIABLE\nCOMMUNICATION\nMEDICAL RECORD\nMANAGEMENT\nIMPROVED\nOUTCOMES\nArista Care Navigators Simplify and Streamline Care\nOur Care Navigators get to know every pet family to help set and meet expectations. They serve as point-person for the collaborative care team—primary, emergency, and specialty care providers—and help facilitate the best outcomes for pets with the resources available.\nWhenever you need to refer or transfer a patient, our Care Navigation team will make the process incredibly easy – you won’t have to worry about the details and we will do our best to keep everyone informed and provide a good experience for your client.\nLearn More About Arista\nAbout Us\nWhat We Do\nCareers\nHome\nLocations\nFind My Arista\nAtlanta\nDallas\nJacksonville\nPet Owners\nEmergency\nSpecialty Referral & Care Navigation\nPayments\nFAQ\nVeterinarians\nMake a Referral\nAbout Care Navigation\nVeterinarian Openings\nAbout Us\nWhat Is Arista?\nOur Leadership\nNews\nBlogs\nContact Us\nCareers\nCompany Overview\nOwnership Opportunities for Veterinarians\nVeterinarians\nCare Navigation & Management\nTechnicians & Assistants\nVeterinarian Openings\nNon-Veterinarian Openings\nMake a Referral\nEmergency\nBelieve In A Better Way\n© 2026 Arista\nInformation on this website is proprietary and confidential.\nThis site is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google\nPrivacy Policy\nand\nTerms of Service\napply.\nBack to Top ^",
